# Training Architecture

Primary training and data-processing work is under [scripts/smooth_policy](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy).

## Preferred Active Flow

- Main training entrypoint: [scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training/amp_training_rma_lsgan.py](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training/amp_training_rma_lsgan.py)
- Core training modules live in [scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training), especially:
  - [demo_loader.py](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training/demo_loader.py)
  - [discriminator.py](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training/discriminator.py)
  - [feature_processing.py](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training/feature_processing.py)
  - [replay_buffer.py](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training/replay_buffer.py)
  - [normalizer.py](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/amp_training/normalizer.py)
- Main configs for this path are in [scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/configs/rma](mdc:scripts/smooth_policy/amp_history/configs/rma).

## Guidance For Edits

- Treat the RMA-LSGAN path as the default when making training changes.
- Keep module boundaries clear: data loading, discriminator logic, feature processing, and replay storage should stay decoupled.
- Other training files in this area are generally legacy or less active; prefer extending the RMA-LSGAN flow unless a task explicitly targets another path.
